	SummonSlot: 召唤栏位占用: [c/22CC22:{Current}/{Total}]
	SummonSlotFull: 召唤栏位占用: [c/CC2222:{Current}/{Total} (已满!)]
	BuffTrackerOn: <left>以打开增益追踪器
